# Normalise line endings in the repository, check out LF on every platform.
# Godot and GDScript are both happy either way, but mixed endings in a text
# file are a reliable source of pointless diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Godot's script UID files must keep their exact contents: a resource
# reference is resolved by the UID inside, and a whitespace change would
# orphan it.
*.uid -text

# Binary assets.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.exr binary
*.hdr binary
*.mtlx text
